flowchart LR
  AG[Agent menulis<br/>blok mermaid] --> MSG[Pesan chat]
  MSG --> RW[flowmaid WASM<br/>di klien]
  RW --> VIEW[Diagram interaktif]
  VIEW -->|drag node| RP[route_partial]
  RP --> VIEW
  VIEW -->|simpan| TM[to_mermaid]
  TM -->|konteks baru| AG
  MSG --> SRV[flowmaid server-side]
  SRV --> PUSH[Thumbnail notif / email]
  classDef new fill:#eaeffc,stroke:#1d3fa0,color:#101828
  classDef old fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c9d2e0,color:#101828
  class RW,RP,TM,SRV new
  class AG,MSG,VIEW,PUSH old
